            </profile>
            <profile id="1e80-bd52-d6c9-99b5" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Chariots Driver and one crewman armed with hand weapon, bow, and light armour. Light Chariots. Chariot Runners have Hand weapon, halberd and shield. May exchange halberd for thrusting spear (free). May have light armour (+2 points). Light Infantry; Chariot Runners. May not be more than 1 unit of chariot runners per chariot model fielded. Units may not be more than 10 figures strong. (i.e. if there is 1 unit of 3 chariots, there may be up to 3 units of runners, each up to 10 figures strong).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="149a-c052-eccc-1533" name="Light Chariots" hidden="false" targetId="1a24-5fa1-b293-3a71" type="rule"/>
